      "text": "How to tell users that a particular seat is\nbooked? In case of hot events, the seat\nmay appear available but is actually booked\nand when the user clicks on it, it is a very\nbad user experience!!",
      "fontSize": 73.17485042712933,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to tell users that a particular seat is booked? In case of hot events, the seat may appear available but is actually booked and when the user clicks on it, it is a very bad user experience!!",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "RAzDnNgmLN5DGkKCiWnXx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10330.908542841396,
      "y": 4814.655284951767,
      "width": 1626.1077872695412,
      "height": 91.46856303391166,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
